2. OBLIGATIONS
================================================================================

Permissive (attribution only — keep copyright + license notice):
  MIT, BSD-3-Clause, Zlib, Apache-2.0 (OpenSSL/ALAC: also keep NOTICE + copyright).

Weak copyleft (LGPL-2.0 FAAC/SHINE, LGPL-2.1 SoXR if linked):
  Ship the full license text (below) and allow the user to replace the library
  (provide the linked object code / a relink mechanism, or the corresponding
  source). The binaries are statically linked, so the LGPL "use a shared library"
  option does not apply; provide the relevant source instead.

