================================================================================
3. KNOWN CONFLICT (unresolved — recorded, not adjudicated)
================================================================================

Upstream's repository root LICENSE says MIT, but the same binary embeds a '-t'
help text that declares GPL-3.0, and embeds mdnssd-min under GPL-3.0. We do not
relicense upstream code and make no legal determination; we surface both and rely
on the full GPL-3.0 text below so the user is informed. If libfaad2 (GPL-2.0-only)
were ever linked alongside the GPL-3.0 components, that combination would be
incompatible; as of 1.12.4 it is NOT linked (proven absent).

